What's new in this beta:
• Analysis has a new "Gasto del día a día" (Daily spending) section: how much you spend each day on one-off expenses, your daily average and days without records. Slide your finger over the bars to pick a day, or turn on "Incluir domiciliados" to add recurring charges.
• Category and payment method details now mark each charge: to confirm, upcoming, not charged or prorated.
Your data stays on your phone only.
